{
  "slug": "recall",
  "name": "Recall",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Persistent conversation recall for Claude Code. Indexes every exchange into a local SQLite database so you can search, browse, and recover context at any time. Survives /clear commands and context compaction. Search across all sessions in a project or globally across every project. Auto-tags technical terms for discovery. Shares findings between parallel sessions via opt-in highlight connections. Includes a PostCompact nudge that automatically re-orients Claude after context loss. Optional proactive skill teaches Claude to detect context loss and suggest recall commands. Zero external dependencies, pure Python stdlib with FTS5 full-text search and WAL mode for concurrent session safety.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **1 command** and **4 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `recall-assistant` (Proactive context recovery, highlight sharing, and session linking for the recall plugin)\n- **Commands** (1): `recall` (Recover context from recent conversation)\n- **Hooks** (4): `SessionStart`, `UserPromptSubmit`, `PreCompact`, `SessionEnd`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install recall@claude-community` from `bledden/claude-recall-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 1,
    "hook": 4,
    "command": 1
  },
